WEBVTT

00:13:25.948 --> 00:13:30.108
però no sigueu seriosos, oblideu l'argot.

00:13:30.108 --> 00:13:33.724
Feu-me riure. Feu-ho interessant.

00:13:33.724 --> 00:13:36.876
Prescindiu dels detallets que no interessen

00:13:36.876 --> 00:13:40.772
i aneu al gra.

00:13:40.772 --> 00:13:42.914
Com hauríeu de começar?

00:13:42.914 --> 00:13:47.188
Podríeu dir: "A veure. Us explicaré una història."

00:13:47.188 --> 00:13:49.238
Gràcies.

00:13:49.238 --> 00:13:50.119
[aplaudiments]